My roommate and I have been playing Priests and Wizards recently, and
we've been having our best games when wishing for:

blessed corrodeproof +2 gauntlets of power

GoP make a great defensive and offensive item.  The 3.1 "weight carrying"
implementation makes having high strength so important that GoP have risen
from our 4th favorite wish to our first favorite!

GoP are like getting a half and half combo of boots of speed and an artifact.
You get to deny critters their extra hit (due to your being burdened) and you
get a nice damage bonus due to your strength!

And here we were wishing for silly things like reflection, life saving,
regeneration, artifacts, conflict, pet Archons and speed...

